  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1426/335/logo-curseforge-fast.gif\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Whenever you go into another biome, the name of the biome pops up at the top of the screen.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Same for dimensions.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Beside that you can edit the text with the inbuilt <strong>settings</strong> screen that <strong>can be opened with the H key</strong> by default.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>So after you open this screen you can</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-switch between biome and dimension settings while clicking on the Biome or dimension button</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-disable these texts whenever you want</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-add a cooldown time between the texts</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-base position</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-text-align</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-max opacity (opacity of the normal text, fade-in goes to this value, and fade-out starts from this value)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-enable the text shadow</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-text size</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-add biomes to a blacklist (just type river for example)&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1426/332/blacklisting.gif\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">also you can edit the fade-in, normal and fade-out texts</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-duration (uses ticks, and 20 tick is 1 second)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-red, green, blue color (colors changes from fade-in to normal, then from normal to fade out)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-x, y move direction (direction changes from fade-in to normal, then from normal to fade out)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Mod currently supports</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.x&nbsp;| 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>SEND ME A PRIVATE MESSAGE IF YOU NEED THE MOD IN A DIFFERENT VERSION OR IF YOU ENCOUNTER ANY BUGS AT CURSEFORGE</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>Follow me on X (twitter)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THIS MOD REQUIRES AQUARIUSLIBS TO BE INSTALLED</strong></a></span></p>",
